# Gatefit adapter ({{TEMPLATE}})

Generated by `gatefit init --template {{TEMPLATE}}`. Gatefit is CI that asserts your access rows survive ugly billing transitions: replayed webhooks, duplicate `invoice.paid`, cancel then re-pay, refunds, disputes, past due, and more. The assertion reads `gatefit_access` in Postgres. A Stripe HTTP 200 is not proof of access.

